body:
closes #20348

Makes the `Series.plot.*` / `DataFrame.plot.*` method docstrings consistent:
- every summary line starts with "Make";
- uniform `**kwargs` wording;
- a `DataFrame.plot` See Also entry everywhere, with a single description of it;
- Returns types are spelled one way, and every Returns section says when an array of Axes comes back (for `box`, a Series).

AI disclosure: drafted with Claude Code (`claude opus 5.5 (high)`), used to audit the docstrings and make the edits.
